# Manual redirect entries (SPEC §8.3). One "old-path new-path" pair per
# line, both site-relative. Compiled at build time into redirects.conf
# alongside every document's own `aliases` front matter entries.
#
# Never add an entry for "/" — it's redundant with the root's own 302
# (SPEC §7.4.1, §8.3) and the build drops it with a warning if you do.

# Existing subscribers move under symmetric prefixes (SPEC §7.11): the
# legacy site's single feed was German, so it now lives at /de/feed.xml.
# A 301 here is what keeps feed readers subscribed rather than silently
# unsubscribing everyone — this entry is written by hand, not generated.
/feed.xml /de/feed.xml
